.TH WHAP 1
.SH NAME
whap \- base defense toy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/whap
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Whap
is a base defense toy.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Move the mouse to stretch the cue ball on its spring and protect a cyan base from other balls.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B mouse move
Stretch ball0 toward pointer
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/whap.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR ode (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
